WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:34.520
=Lady Liberty=

01:35.020 --> 01:37.980
=Episode 15=

01:44.420 --> 01:44.900
So?

01:46.044 --> 01:47.488
Think it through carefully.

01:52.220 --> 01:52.660
Mr. Fan,

01:53.180 --> 01:54.260
give me a straight answer.

01:55.300 --> 01:56.420
How much of this

01:56.900 --> 01:58.820
is based on Chenxing's
value in your eyes,

02:00.140 --> 02:01.620
and how much is because of He Han?

02:02.420 --> 02:04.660
Of course, it's because of Chenxing.

02:04.900 --> 02:06.060
I am investing in Chenxing.

02:06.900 --> 02:08.820
What I value is Chenxing's future.

02:10.300 --> 02:11.780
Then, what if

02:12.111 --> 02:13.444
He Han is not part of that future?

02:15.660 --> 02:16.900
Weren't you just...

02:22.540 --> 02:23.620
It's such a pity

02:23.620 --> 02:24.780
that you are not together.

02:25.100 --> 02:27.140
Right now, He Han
is a freelance creator.

02:27.140 --> 02:28.900
He is not tied to any company.

02:29.380 --> 02:30.444
Doesn't it mean

02:30.866 --> 02:32.860
that he is just
waiting to return to Chenxing?

02:33.140 --> 02:33.820
He Han and I

02:33.820 --> 02:35.933
are just old friends who
look out for each other.

02:37.220 --> 02:38.660
I hope those who invest in Chenxing

02:39.500 --> 02:41.500
value Chenxing and me,

02:41.933 --> 02:43.600
not a bundled deal with He Han.

02:44.644 --> 02:45.511
I understand.

02:46.340 --> 02:46.980
I understand.

02:47.980 --> 02:48.700
I know

02:49.060 --> 02:50.140
you have integrity.

02:51.260 --> 02:51.820
As for me,

02:52.540 --> 02:54.060
what I value is you

02:54.620 --> 02:55.940
and your Chenxing.

02:56.340 --> 02:57.220
As for He Han,

02:57.740 --> 02:59.980
he is just an added bonus.

03:00.600 --> 03:01.666
How do you prove that?

03:01.700 --> 03:02.460
In business,

03:02.860 --> 03:04.060
money is proof.

03:05.133 --> 03:06.688
I won't change the number here.

03:07.377 --> 03:09.000
That should be proof enough, right?

03:12.488 --> 03:14.755
Remove the parts related
to He Han in the contract.

03:15.100 --> 03:16.355
We can talk another time.

03:20.740 --> 03:21.660
No need.

03:23.660 --> 03:24.660
We can do it now.

03:27.020 --> 03:28.140
I have prepared

03:28.340 --> 03:29.300
both options.

03:29.820 --> 03:31.330
You can take them back and review them.

03:31.355 --> 03:32.044
That is fine.

03:32.155 --> 03:33.666
Then, over the next couple of days,

03:33.740 --> 03:35.740
let's get it signed as
soon as possible, alright?

03:36.900 --> 03:38.100
I may not be that fast.

03:38.340 --> 03:39.700
The sooner, the better.

03:44.820 --> 03:45.620
I need to go in now.

04:33.622 --> 04:34.420
Instant noodles?

04:34.444 --> 04:35.260
Careful. It's hot.

04:43.180 --> 04:43.460
Hey,

04:43.860 --> 04:44.980
where are you working now?

04:45.422 --> 04:46.660
This is your alt account, right?

04:46.940 --> 04:47.260
Bro,

04:47.820 --> 04:48.540
join our guild.

04:48.600 --> 04:49.422
Let's play together.

04:58.980 --> 04:59.666
Come here.

05:00.100 --> 05:00.660
What?

05:00.660 --> 05:01.380
I said come here.

05:11.022 --> 05:13.133
So Lin Zhanqiao still
ended up pushing you around.

05:13.140 --> 05:13.700
What happened?

05:13.700 --> 05:15.511
Got new people and stopped valuing you?

05:16.820 --> 05:17.620
To be fair,

05:17.860 --> 05:19.780
you do look quite sharp now.

05:20.020 --> 05:21.340
That's you, darn it.

05:22.740 --> 05:24.450
Watch your words, Mr. Gu Yan.

05:24.450 --> 05:25.900
Don't be sarcastic or snide here.

05:26.780 --> 05:28.260
No, you just want to dress like this,

05:28.420 --> 05:30.177
but don't want to be judged and ranked.

05:30.266 --> 05:32.030
But let me tell you,
once you dress like this,

05:32.044 --> 05:33.377
you will be judged and ranked.

05:33.644 --> 05:35.288
Because you are already in that system.

05:37.000 --> 05:38.377
It feels uncomfortable to wear,

05:38.911 --> 05:39.733
so I won't wear it.

05:42.244 --> 05:44.133
If it's uncomfortable,
then just don't wear it.

05:48.980 --> 05:49.540
That is right.

05:50.555 --> 05:51.555
I won't wear it.

06:01.977 --> 06:03.022
You are really cutting it?

06:04.860 --> 06:05.660
With this one snip,

06:06.022 --> 06:06.980
a thousand is gone.

06:09.711 --> 06:10.888
Would he not feel the loss?

06:11.180 --> 06:12.200
Help me cut it, too.

06:12.620 --> 06:13.420
You said it.

06:13.980 --> 06:14.740
No compensation.

06:14.740 --> 06:15.180
Cut it.

06:15.180 --> 06:16.140
But we are not paying for it.

06:16.140 --> 06:16.620
Cut it.

06:17.020 --> 06:17.540
You said it.

06:17.860 --> 06:18.780
This feels great. I...

06:19.111 --> 06:20.666
These scissors are sharp. Just cut it.

06:22.311 --> 06:23.580
If you keep cutting like this,

06:23.580 --> 06:25.100
will he not make you pay for it?

06:59.900 --> 07:00.860
Gu Yan's award.

07:01.355 --> 07:03.133
He is not here, and neither are you,

07:03.244 --> 07:04.620
so I accepted it on your behalf.

07:10.500 --> 07:10.940
So?

07:11.580 --> 07:12.100
All settled?

07:15.340 --> 07:16.180
I got Mr. Fan,

07:17.060 --> 07:17.820
but I lost Gu Yan.

07:18.500 --> 07:19.340
That won't happen.

07:19.866 --> 07:21.580
He is just throwing a bit of a tantrum.

07:21.580 --> 07:22.650
He is easy to calm down.

07:22.650 --> 07:24.300
Just explain things clearly to him.

07:27.300 --> 07:28.900
Think back to when the two of us

07:32.300 --> 07:33.700
decided to build Chenxing together.

07:35.740 --> 07:36.660
Up until now,

07:37.355 --> 07:38.933
it has only been five or six years.

07:43.660 --> 07:45.260
If I sign this paper,

07:46.733 --> 07:47.977
it will all be over.

07:54.900 --> 07:56.620
Mr. Fan takes 70 percent,

07:58.260 --> 07:59.620
and I keep 30 percent.

08:01.980 --> 08:03.660
I may become an employee,

08:04.460 --> 08:05.200
but at least,

08:07.500 --> 08:09.060
Chenxing's name will still be there.

08:09.700 --> 08:11.140
That makes me feel a little better.

08:16.100 --> 08:17.500
No matter what,

08:18.688 --> 08:21.333
it's still better than losing
the whole company, right?

08:31.644 --> 08:32.933
If you don't want to sell it,

08:34.020 --> 08:35.022
then don't sell it.

08:35.300 --> 08:36.980
There will always be
a way to keep going.

08:39.180 --> 08:39.900
Who are you?

08:40.740 --> 08:42.860
You are Lin Zhanqiao. Come on.

08:46.460 --> 08:47.100
Listen,

08:48.820 --> 08:50.620
smash this trophy right now.

08:50.940 --> 08:51.580
Let it all out.

08:53.500 --> 08:54.660
Smash it. Smash it hard.

08:54.740 --> 08:56.980
Just like you smashed
our trophy back then.

08:56.980 --> 08:57.820
Smash it hard.

09:01.700 --> 09:03.420
I didn't do that on purpose back then.

09:03.820 --> 09:05.140
Then, do it on purpose now.

09:06.020 --> 09:07.644
Is your broken trophy still around?

09:07.940 --> 09:08.500
Of course.

09:10.940 --> 09:12.620
Mr. Fan said he would get us a new one.

09:12.620 --> 09:13.620
I said no.

09:14.300 --> 09:16.340
A trophy full of scars is a real trophy,

09:16.700 --> 09:17.420
right?

09:22.340 --> 09:23.020
Smash it.

09:23.111 --> 09:24.580
If you won't, I'll do it for you.

09:24.733 --> 09:26.540
Why are you so determined
to make me smash it?

09:26.540 --> 09:28.320
Then, I'll smash it.
If you won't, I'll.

09:28.500 --> 09:30.311
Or are you afraid Gu Yan will get mad?

09:30.580 --> 09:31.460
Not at all.

09:32.620 --> 09:33.940
He is very emotionally stable.

09:34.140 --> 09:35.020
Calm and composed.

09:35.780 --> 09:38.244
At most, when he is upset,
he just leaves for a while.

09:38.580 --> 09:39.580
At least, from now on,

09:39.580 --> 09:40.580
I won't have to worry

09:40.740 --> 09:41.860
that at any time, anywhere,

09:41.860 --> 09:44.100
I may have to go
clean up someone's mess.

09:50.700 --> 09:51.460
Are you saying that

09:52.660 --> 09:53.580
because you miss me?

09:56.780 --> 09:57.180
Right?

09:57.420 --> 09:59.660
The show is over for today, okay?

09:59.660 --> 10:01.780
Your acting was very obvious today.

10:01.940 --> 10:02.580
Was it?

10:02.580 --> 10:03.180
Of course.

10:03.422 --> 10:05.355
There was so much
applause from the audience.

10:05.360 --> 10:06.660
That means I was right.

10:06.660 --> 10:09.020
That was because
I led the applause, okay?

10:09.020 --> 10:09.940
You led the applause?

10:09.940 --> 10:10.260
Yes.

10:10.260 --> 10:12.140
Why didn't you
stand up and lead it for us?

10:12.580 --> 10:14.260
A few men beside you had fallen asleep.

10:18.580 --> 10:19.940
You should go back first.

10:20.260 --> 10:21.500
They have plans tonight.

10:21.500 --> 10:23.111
I don't know when they will be back.

10:23.711 --> 10:24.755
I am not in a hurry.

10:24.911 --> 10:26.266
I have nowhere to go anyway.

10:28.740 --> 10:30.540
Don't you develop so many hotels?

10:30.622 --> 10:32.260
You are always pointing at some hotel

10:32.260 --> 10:33.210
and saying you built it,

10:33.222 --> 10:34.955
and they still owe you tens of millions.

10:35.420 --> 10:36.620
Why not find a hotel now,

10:36.820 --> 10:37.700
take a bath,

10:38.180 --> 10:39.540
drink some warm milk,

10:39.780 --> 10:41.140
and get a good sleep?

10:42.888 --> 10:44.377
I'll stay another half hour.

10:44.444 --> 10:46.377
Go on with your work.
I won't bother you.

10:49.180 --> 10:49.940
I think

10:50.380 --> 10:51.500
staying in this room

10:52.422 --> 10:53.660
feels especially comfortable.

10:54.380 --> 10:55.140
Do you know why?

10:56.420 --> 10:56.940
No.

10:57.900 --> 10:59.420
Because your boss

11:00.100 --> 11:01.940
has excellent taste in decor.

11:02.660 --> 11:04.260
You know how many people spend a fortune

11:04.260 --> 11:06.050
making their homes look like palaces,

11:06.050 --> 11:07.488
only for them to feel uncomfortable?

11:07.660 --> 11:09.220
That is just paying to suffer.

11:09.660 --> 11:10.380
Look at you,

11:11.700 --> 11:13.340
and your boss's female friend, Zhou Mei.

11:13.700 --> 11:15.100
Why do you both like living here?

11:15.260 --> 11:16.288
That makes sense.

11:17.088 --> 11:18.580
Are you talking to me about this

11:18.580 --> 11:20.820
because you really
have no other girlfriends to ask out?

11:22.620 --> 11:24.340
Asking out other girlfriends right now

11:24.460 --> 11:25.460
would only upset me.

11:28.460 --> 11:29.780
What I need right now is peace.

11:32.860 --> 11:33.340
She's back.

11:35.260 --> 11:35.660
Ms. Lin.

11:36.340 --> 11:36.860
Ms. Lin.

11:37.820 --> 11:38.940
Ms. Lin...

11:39.622 --> 11:41.177
Qian Jingjing has been discharged.

11:41.340 --> 11:42.530
She is finally out.

11:42.530 --> 11:44.300
I don't plan to get
married anymore either.

11:44.860 --> 11:45.740
Before the wedding,

11:45.900 --> 11:47.244
being able to see a person clearly

11:47.420 --> 11:48.580
is heaven's arrangement.

11:49.666 --> 11:50.888
It's a good thing.

11:51.380 --> 11:52.660
Hasn't Zhangzhu always hoped

11:52.660 --> 11:53.990
you wouldn't get married again?

11:54.133 --> 11:56.270
As long as you have handled it
and thought it through.

11:56.380 --> 11:57.540
But he hasn't handled it.

11:58.140 --> 11:59.140
It's about the house.

11:59.420 --> 12:00.140
That house

12:00.140 --> 12:01.866
was originally
renovated for the wedding.

12:01.900 --> 12:03.380
But since the wedding is off,

12:03.540 --> 12:04.740
Qian Jingjing got so angry

12:04.740 --> 12:06.140
that she smashed the whole place.

12:07.488 --> 12:09.133
What do you mean by the whole place?

12:09.380 --> 12:11.100
She really smashed everything.

12:11.180 --> 12:12.311
Look at these photos.

12:14.660 --> 12:15.740
Everything is shattered.

12:17.460 --> 12:19.340
Wasn't Qian Jingjing's bone fractured?

12:19.700 --> 12:21.666
How could she still
smash things so badly?

12:22.260 --> 12:24.022
It's a house of 200-300 square meters.

12:24.620 --> 12:26.140
We must call the police. This is

12:26.260 --> 12:28.020
the destruction of
someone else's property.

12:28.020 --> 12:29.288
Once she is out of the hospital,

12:29.290 --> 12:30.800
she should spend
some time at the police station.

12:30.820 --> 12:31.500
Forget it.

12:32.140 --> 12:33.688
I build houses and do renovations.

12:33.690 --> 12:35.466
If it's smashed,
I'll just make a new one.

12:35.470 --> 12:37.044
The main thing is that no one gets hurt.

12:37.220 --> 12:38.500
Ms. Lin, I just think

12:38.700 --> 12:40.755
Zhangzhu will still be
staying here for a while.

12:41.100 --> 12:42.810
If... I mean,

12:42.810 --> 12:44.533
if Qian Jingjing comes here
to cause trouble

12:45.100 --> 12:47.340
and tries to smash your place,

12:48.060 --> 12:49.940
you must protect the people first.

12:50.044 --> 12:52.260
If anything gets broken,
I'll replace it for you.

12:53.540 --> 12:54.980
Until this matter is settled,

12:54.980 --> 12:56.850
I'll send people here
every day to stand guard.

12:57.244 --> 12:59.466
First, there is no need to
have someone on duty.

12:59.780 --> 13:00.980
She probably won't hurt anyone.

13:01.260 --> 13:02.844
At most, she will just make a scene.

13:03.220 --> 13:04.940
Besides, you are here
to clean things up.

13:06.180 --> 13:06.540
Second,

13:07.180 --> 13:08.900
she probably won't go after Zhangzhu.

13:09.022 --> 13:10.940
After all,
the reason you called off the wedding

13:10.940 --> 13:11.980
has nothing to do with her.

13:13.940 --> 13:15.940
Ms. Lin, you really see things clearly.

13:16.820 --> 13:18.300
You are the most insightful

13:18.420 --> 13:19.260
and composed woman

13:19.500 --> 13:20.580
I have ever met.

13:20.700 --> 13:21.340
For example...

13:21.980 --> 13:23.140
Where are you staying tonight?

13:25.660 --> 13:26.420
There are already

13:27.220 --> 13:28.580
three women here.

13:28.740 --> 13:30.380
It's not convenient
for me to stay, right?

13:30.740 --> 13:32.020
I was not asking you to stay here.

13:32.088 --> 13:34.450
What I mean is, you don't have to
go back to your place either.

13:34.460 --> 13:35.777
It has already been smashed anyway.

13:38.740 --> 13:39.260
Well,

13:40.620 --> 13:41.860
alright then.

13:41.860 --> 13:42.660
I'll just

13:43.340 --> 13:44.420
find somewhere else to stay.

13:44.540 --> 13:45.220
That is easy.

13:45.980 --> 13:48.140
After this is settled,

13:48.260 --> 13:49.940
I'll fix up your place properly.

13:51.300 --> 13:53.660
And I'll thank
your female friend as well.

13:54.180 --> 13:55.140
I'll get going, then.

13:56.300 --> 13:56.700
Alright.

14:05.580 --> 14:06.100
I am leaving.

14:12.950 --> 14:14.688
Now that your dad
is not getting married,

14:14.733 --> 14:16.111
shouldn't you celebrate?

14:16.311 --> 14:18.511
Once this one is gone,
another one comes right after.

14:22.380 --> 14:23.844
My dad is actually a good person.

14:24.300 --> 14:26.060
He just keeps falling
for the wrong women.

14:26.060 --> 14:27.511
What kind of problem is that?

14:28.111 --> 14:29.340
If you say he is love-obsessed,

14:29.500 --> 14:31.180
he can immediately fall for someone else

14:31.340 --> 14:32.733
and chase after her like crazy.

14:33.660 --> 14:34.820
It has left me with a shadow.

14:34.955 --> 14:36.780
Whenever a man pursues me,
I think of my dad,

14:36.940 --> 14:38.200
and I feel it's ridiculous.

14:40.500 --> 14:41.460
So now,

14:41.888 --> 14:43.380
I am always the one pursuing men.

14:44.420 --> 14:47.220
And the colder a man is toward me,

14:47.220 --> 14:48.100
the more I feel

14:48.500 --> 14:50.140
it's strangely addictive.

14:51.740 --> 14:53.100
Like someone like Mr. He Han.

14:55.100 --> 14:56.340
How is He Han cold toward you?

14:56.340 --> 14:57.620
Isn't he quite warm with you?

14:57.900 --> 14:58.860
No.

14:59.220 --> 15:01.620
He is only enthusiastic
when talking about you,

15:01.620 --> 15:02.740
not about me.

15:04.420 --> 15:06.100
But I am still happy.

15:08.060 --> 15:09.100
As long as I can see him,

15:09.100 --> 15:10.220
I feel happy.

15:11.620 --> 15:13.060
Were you the one chasing him before?

15:13.500 --> 15:13.980
No.

15:14.260 --> 15:15.088
So, he chased you?

15:15.620 --> 15:16.380
Not really.

15:17.020 --> 15:18.644
Then, how did you two get together?

15:20.900 --> 15:21.620
We argued.

15:22.420 --> 15:23.780
We argued our way into it.

15:24.222 --> 15:25.260
What kind of arguments?

15:25.260 --> 15:25.620
Were they

15:26.540 --> 15:28.220
playful arguments or real fights?

15:29.260 --> 15:29.740
Real fights.

15:31.311 --> 15:32.933
The kind that could blow the place up.

15:32.977 --> 15:34.622
How did you make up after fighting?

15:35.777 --> 15:37.288
Zhou Mei hasn't come back yet.

15:37.466 --> 15:39.311
She asked me to
leave the door open for her.

15:39.860 --> 15:41.060
So, how did you make up?

15:44.660 --> 15:45.060
I forgot.

16:03.060 --> 16:07.900
(Three Years Ago)

16:08.300 --> 16:10.380
♪If the sky and the sea
turned upside down♪

16:10.380 --> 16:10.860
Thanks.

16:15.577 --> 16:17.088
You didn't take the trophy.

16:20.220 --> 16:20.860
Wait.

16:21.300 --> 16:22.100
Stop.

16:23.260 --> 16:29.980
♪If back then we had never let go♪

16:30.740 --> 16:35.940
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

16:38.020 --> 16:40.140
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

16:40.380 --> 16:41.980
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

16:42.220 --> 16:43.860
♪And found our way back whole♪

16:43.860 --> 16:44.580
Doesn't it work?

16:44.820 --> 16:46.060
I am just not used to

16:46.060 --> 16:47.340
seeing you so proper.

16:48.580 --> 16:50.300
I am not used to your outfit either.

16:50.460 --> 16:51.540
Wearing pants under a skirt.

16:52.466 --> 16:53.420
What were you thinking?

16:53.420 --> 16:55.700
- Seriously? Is it not something new?
- Who did you learn that from?

16:55.700 --> 16:56.700
Just tell me if it looks good or not.

16:56.700 --> 16:58.340
Next time you get me a suit,

16:58.340 --> 17:00.020
can you make it a bit looser?

17:00.500 --> 17:02.500
These pants are way too tight today.

17:02.860 --> 17:07.060
♪This one eternal photograph♪

17:07.940 --> 17:10.260
You wrote over
two million words in a year.

17:11.020 --> 17:12.940
Finally got a trophy like this,

17:12.940 --> 17:14.380
and I broke it.

17:15.020 --> 17:16.500
It's fine. It's just a trophy.

17:16.500 --> 17:17.560
If it's broken, it's fine.

17:17.570 --> 17:18.980
We got the honor, right?

17:19.220 --> 17:21.180
But the trophy matters, too.

17:22.220 --> 17:23.644
Then, we will write another one.

17:26.460 --> 17:28.220
Even if we do, it won't say

17:28.220 --> 17:31.420
Outstanding Author of 2021 anymore.

17:31.420 --> 17:32.410
Well, of course.

17:32.410 --> 17:33.700
Next year would be 2022, right?

18:30.380 --> 18:30.940
He Han, look.

18:32.220 --> 18:32.860
Found it.

18:33.000 --> 18:34.220
Is that a preserved egg?

18:38.060 --> 18:38.380
Hey,

18:38.740 --> 18:39.540
don't fall asleep.

18:39.620 --> 18:40.380
I am not asleep.

18:41.940 --> 18:43.140
Stop lying.

18:43.980 --> 18:44.540
Wake up.

18:46.620 --> 18:47.940
I heard it.

18:48.620 --> 18:49.780
I was not snoring.

18:50.740 --> 18:52.180
Then, who was snoring?

18:59.180 --> 19:02.500
(He Han, The Desert Rises to Fame)

19:16.420 --> 19:20.900
(He Han, The Desert Rises to Fame)

20:05.866 --> 20:06.970
You are not sleepy, right?

20:07.220 --> 20:07.780
No.

20:08.111 --> 20:08.977
You are sleepy?

20:09.420 --> 20:09.900
I am not.

20:10.088 --> 20:11.822
How could I feel
sleepy when I am with you?

20:12.066 --> 20:13.666
I am not disturbing your work, am I?

20:13.700 --> 20:14.444
Not at all.

20:15.340 --> 20:15.900
That is good.

20:37.020 --> 20:38.260
You came back late tonight.

20:38.666 --> 20:40.260
We even went to the police station.

20:40.660 --> 20:42.111
Zhang Yousen got into a fight.

20:42.500 --> 20:43.260
What about now?

20:43.700 --> 20:44.420
Is he all right?

20:45.260 --> 20:45.900
He is fine.

20:47.660 --> 20:48.820
Why did he get into a fight?

20:49.980 --> 20:51.540
Just a young man trying to show off.

20:51.600 --> 20:52.977
Picking trouble for no reason.

21:01.060 --> 21:01.660
Nice.

21:11.222 --> 21:12.444
What are you doing?

21:12.900 --> 21:14.140
Showing respect to a beauty.

21:19.688 --> 21:21.066
Zhou Mei, you should go first.

21:34.933 --> 21:36.777
Do you know
how awkward this is for me?

21:37.000 --> 21:38.260
I am already in my thirties,

21:38.260 --> 21:39.866
yet I still have to watch my boyfriend

21:39.888 --> 21:41.577
rolling around
on the ground with a thug.

21:42.980 --> 21:43.940
It's always like that.

21:44.620 --> 21:45.866
You cannot just avoid it.

21:46.260 --> 21:47.700
What about your other boyfriends?

21:47.710 --> 21:49.466
What would they do
in a situation like this?

21:49.500 --> 21:50.955
Why are you not going to sleep?

21:51.140 --> 21:52.300
With a topic this interesting,

21:52.300 --> 21:53.488
I would be wide awake.

21:55.140 --> 21:56.260
My other boyfriends

21:56.466 --> 21:58.155
wouldn't do something like this.

21:59.220 --> 22:00.580
Look at you,

22:00.688 --> 22:02.222
spending all night with Zhang Yousen

22:02.260 --> 22:04.022
playing games until
dawn before coming back.

22:04.100 --> 22:05.200
What are you trying to do?

22:05.244 --> 22:06.733
Well, when you are in a relationship,

22:06.780 --> 22:08.977
you have to do something
to pass the long nights.

22:09.260 --> 22:10.580
If you go home right after dinner,

22:10.740 --> 22:11.940
it kills the mood.

22:13.060 --> 22:14.700
Going to a hotel or watching a movie...

22:15.220 --> 22:17.060
I am not in the mood
for that with him yet.

22:22.980 --> 22:23.540
Go to sleep.

22:28.140 --> 22:28.940
Go to sleep.

22:47.488 --> 22:49.980
(Zhanqiao: You are waiting
for Lawyer Bei to come find you.)

23:10.460 --> 23:16.300
(May: He owes me an explanation.)

23:39.900 --> 23:40.755
Hello, what is it?

23:41.140 --> 23:41.977
Are you at home?

23:42.400 --> 23:44.290
I want you to help buy
breakfast for my grandmother.

23:44.300 --> 23:45.977
She cannot take her medicine
on an empty stomach.

23:46.066 --> 23:47.100
The helper stopped coming.

23:47.311 --> 23:48.177
I am on my way now.

23:52.020 --> 23:52.420
Thank you.

23:52.540 --> 23:52.940
Take care.

24:18.460 --> 24:19.260
Min.

24:19.780 --> 24:20.250
Grandma.

24:20.250 --> 24:22.060
I am Ling Yikai's girlfriend.

24:22.140 --> 24:23.060
My name is Zhao Lanxin.

24:23.340 --> 24:24.380
I brought you breakfast.

24:24.488 --> 24:25.650
You haven't eaten yet, right?

24:25.660 --> 24:26.460
Where is Min?

24:27.311 --> 24:29.100
She has something to
take care of these days.

24:29.180 --> 24:30.540
Ling Yikai asked me to come.

24:32.780 --> 24:34.580
I brought you vegetable buns,

24:35.180 --> 24:35.780
Shaomai,

24:35.860 --> 24:36.700
wonton,

24:37.020 --> 24:37.780
and soy milk.

24:38.220 --> 24:38.700
Come, sit.

24:39.460 --> 24:40.460
Which one would you like?

24:41.460 --> 24:42.300
I won't eat.

24:43.060 --> 24:44.020
I'll wait for Min.

24:45.340 --> 24:45.780
Grandma,

24:46.220 --> 24:46.900
it's like this.

24:47.620 --> 24:49.340
I am staying next door now.

24:49.533 --> 24:51.466
The helper has
something to handle these days,

24:51.511 --> 24:52.955
so I am bringing your meals.

24:53.260 --> 24:55.860
You have to take
these medicines after eating.

24:56.260 --> 24:57.100
If you don't eat now,

24:57.100 --> 24:58.911
it will be past the time to take them.

24:59.140 --> 24:59.620
But...

25:00.380 --> 25:02.540
I don't even know
what medicine I am taking.

25:03.100 --> 25:04.260
Min always

25:04.260 --> 25:05.860
prepared them for me.

25:07.060 --> 25:07.700
Grandma,

25:08.060 --> 25:08.900
it's all right.

25:08.980 --> 25:10.820
I have checked and memorized everything.

25:11.540 --> 25:12.860
Losartan potassium tablets,

25:13.220 --> 25:14.660
metformin capsules,

25:14.980 --> 25:16.140
and triamterene tablets.

25:16.511 --> 25:17.577
Did I get them right?

25:19.300 --> 25:20.340
I am so sorry.

25:20.780 --> 25:21.740
Min didn't

25:21.820 --> 25:22.660
inform us.

25:22.660 --> 25:23.888
She just left on her own.

25:25.860 --> 25:27.380
Actually, Mr. Ling, you know...

25:28.220 --> 25:29.540
It's not easy to find a helper

25:29.940 --> 25:31.020
for your grandmother.

25:31.860 --> 25:33.340
Min left because

25:33.555 --> 25:34.820
it's too dark here at night.

25:34.900 --> 25:36.100
She could not settle in here,

25:36.500 --> 25:37.060
so she left.

25:38.180 --> 25:38.900
I understand.

25:41.980 --> 25:42.820
I'll pay more.

25:43.844 --> 25:45.280
Please help me find someone suitable.

25:45.290 --> 25:45.955
Help me.

25:46.460 --> 25:46.860
Please.

25:49.500 --> 25:49.980
Grandma,

25:50.260 --> 25:52.300
let me show you how
to recognize these pills.

25:52.377 --> 25:54.140
Just in case you need
to take them yourself,

25:54.260 --> 25:55.660
or someone else gives them to you,

25:55.670 --> 25:56.540
you will at least know

25:56.540 --> 25:57.540
what you are taking.

25:58.220 --> 25:58.620
Alright.

25:59.140 --> 25:59.460
Come.

26:00.180 --> 26:01.533
Grandma, give me your hand.

26:04.140 --> 26:05.820
Let's feel this capsule first.

26:06.980 --> 26:09.100
This is the metformin capsule.

26:09.900 --> 26:10.740
Can you feel

26:10.860 --> 26:11.980
the shape of the capsule?

26:12.820 --> 26:13.210
Alright.

26:13.210 --> 26:14.420
Let's try another one.

26:14.540 --> 26:15.060
This one.

26:15.260 --> 26:16.340
Oval-shaped,

26:16.580 --> 26:17.980
a little thicker.

26:18.940 --> 26:20.660
This is the losartan potassium tablet.

26:24.020 --> 26:24.700
Can you feel it?

26:25.400 --> 26:26.850
There is another one that is similar.

26:26.860 --> 26:27.940
Here, give me your hand.

26:28.500 --> 26:29.980
This one is also oval-shaped.

26:41.100 --> 26:43.180
Before the agency finds a new helper,

26:43.180 --> 26:44.260
you can leave Grandma to me.

26:49.066 --> 26:51.377
It will still take another week.
Aren't you going to work?

26:51.900 --> 26:52.860
It's just one week.

26:53.060 --> 26:54.311
I can take her with me to work.

27:03.220 --> 27:03.660
Thank you.

27:06.644 --> 27:07.511
I am leaving.

27:28.540 --> 27:30.380
When you go to
the office later, and they ask,

27:30.460 --> 27:32.022
think about what you are going to say.

27:32.340 --> 27:32.780
It's fine.

27:33.260 --> 27:34.488
Lawyer Bei already knows.

27:36.340 --> 27:37.340
No idea who

27:37.460 --> 27:38.780
was so quick to pass it on.

27:42.300 --> 27:43.980
So, what did he say to you?

27:44.660 --> 27:45.940
He asked about what happened.

27:47.020 --> 27:48.420
I figured there was nothing

27:48.900 --> 27:49.820
I couldn't tell him,

27:50.380 --> 27:51.300
so I told him.

27:51.600 --> 27:52.577
Who would have thought

27:53.260 --> 27:54.820
that he thinks being in a relationship

27:54.820 --> 27:56.066
is affecting my work.

27:56.222 --> 27:57.800
He told me to weigh the pros and cons

27:57.940 --> 27:58.940
and promise him

27:59.340 --> 28:01.020
that work comes before love.

28:01.380 --> 28:02.059
Otherwise,

28:02.060 --> 28:03.620
he will reconsider whether I stay.

28:05.220 --> 28:06.380
As your supervisor,

28:06.466 --> 28:09.111
it's fair that he said something after
you ended up at the police station.

28:09.180 --> 28:11.022
He has never really
been in a relationship.

28:11.820 --> 28:12.380
Or rather,

28:12.780 --> 28:14.180
he has never truly loved someone.

28:14.180 --> 28:15.377
So he wouldn't understand.

28:15.660 --> 28:16.900
When he married his wife,

28:17.180 --> 28:18.860
it was because of her family background.

28:19.500 --> 28:20.220
I told him

28:20.980 --> 28:22.580
the fight was my responsibility.

28:22.700 --> 28:23.620
It won't happen again.

28:23.911 --> 28:26.666
But asking me to restrain my
relationship? It's not going to happen.

28:26.860 --> 28:28.700
People may be able to stop many things,

28:29.020 --> 28:30.900
but the one thing
they cannot stop is love.

28:30.900 --> 28:31.260
Right?

28:31.340 --> 28:31.860
Then,

28:33.140 --> 28:33.980
what did he say?

28:34.580 --> 28:35.420
He asked me

28:35.540 --> 28:36.860
to pause my work

28:37.300 --> 28:38.860
and take two days to write a reflection.

28:39.580 --> 28:40.300
What is that?

28:40.577 --> 28:41.666
Am I a school student?

28:42.340 --> 28:43.260
Not allowed to date?

28:43.688 --> 28:44.940
He can fire me if he wants,

28:45.000 --> 28:46.533
but I am not writing any reflection.

28:46.740 --> 28:47.780
If he really fires me,

28:48.060 --> 28:49.340
I'll tell everyone at the firm

28:49.460 --> 28:50.260
that I was dismissed

28:50.260 --> 28:51.511
because I believe in love.

28:54.060 --> 28:54.820
Pull over.

28:57.222 --> 28:58.022
Alright.

29:02.333 --> 29:03.940
I'll take a taxi back to the office.

29:04.022 --> 29:05.533
You go back and write the reflection.

29:05.644 --> 29:07.844
Submit it to Lawyer Bei
before the end of the day.

29:08.060 --> 29:09.740
If you lose this job,

29:09.740 --> 29:10.688
then we are done.

29:10.755 --> 29:12.155
Do not feel pressured.

29:12.177 --> 29:13.780
What I choose to do is my own decision.

29:13.780 --> 29:15.150
It has nothing to do with you, Zhou Mei.

29:15.177 --> 29:16.066
I am not joking.

29:31.780 --> 29:33.060
Are you free at noon?

29:33.377 --> 29:34.400
I want to see you.

29:47.140 --> 29:48.380
I was about to find you

29:48.740 --> 29:50.060
if you hadn't come to me.

29:51.777 --> 29:53.422
You are not planning
to fire Zhang Yousen

29:53.430 --> 29:54.333
over this, are you?

29:54.540 --> 29:56.220
If he gets dismissed now, it'll be hard

29:56.644 --> 29:58.266
for him to find another job later.

29:58.780 --> 30:00.540
I am not going to fire Zhang Yousen.

30:01.380 --> 30:04.300
But for his inappropriate behavior,

30:05.100 --> 30:06.980
asking him to write a reflection

30:07.644 --> 30:09.444
is part of company policy, right?

30:10.700 --> 30:11.860
What if he refuses?

30:16.220 --> 30:17.460
Then, I'll write it for him.

30:20.540 --> 30:22.020
He is young and capable,

30:22.620 --> 30:24.580
and he hasn't done
anything unforgivable.

30:24.580 --> 30:26.180
Why would I fire him?

30:26.780 --> 30:27.500
But...

30:28.620 --> 30:29.220
But what?

30:31.820 --> 30:32.780
I hope you

30:33.700 --> 30:34.940
don't hold back his future.

30:36.540 --> 30:37.860
I am holding back his future?

30:37.911 --> 30:38.780
Do you know that now

30:38.780 --> 30:40.660
he goes to work every day,
looking worn out?

30:41.488 --> 30:43.288
With dark circles under his eyes,

30:43.900 --> 30:45.260
he even dozes off during meetings.

30:45.780 --> 30:47.820
It's already affecting the company.

30:47.940 --> 30:48.900
And all of this

30:50.180 --> 30:51.340
is because of you.

30:57.420 --> 30:58.180
I plan

30:58.900 --> 30:59.620
to transfer him

30:59.733 --> 31:01.133
to the Southwest Branch.

31:04.066 --> 31:05.540
What if he does not want to go?

31:05.733 --> 31:07.020
After two years, he can come back

31:07.540 --> 31:08.780
and apply for his license.

31:09.420 --> 31:11.420
Then, he can take cases on his own

31:12.100 --> 31:13.500
and build up his own clients.

31:13.860 --> 31:14.940
In a few years,

31:15.066 --> 31:17.422
he might even become
the youngest partner in the firm.

31:17.580 --> 31:18.540
If it were me,

31:18.733 --> 31:20.311
I would want that opportunity.

31:21.220 --> 31:22.620
You are trying to send him away

31:22.777 --> 31:24.400
because you are jealous, right?

31:28.260 --> 31:30.380
I don't want you making use
of an innocent young man.

31:32.140 --> 31:34.420
I have every reason to dismiss him,

31:34.860 --> 31:35.780
but I believe

31:35.933 --> 31:37.844
you wouldn't want to see that happen.

31:39.340 --> 31:40.660
Many relationships begin

31:41.100 --> 31:42.020
by accident,

31:42.311 --> 31:43.711
in a moment of impulse.

31:44.980 --> 31:46.500
If you have any issues with me,

31:46.500 --> 31:47.420
take it out on me.

31:47.666 --> 31:49.377
Do not drag innocent people into it.

31:49.500 --> 31:51.420
That will only bring you more trouble.

31:58.177 --> 32:00.060
What right do I have
to take issue with you?

32:08.020 --> 32:10.180
Shouldn't everything
between us be pleasant?

32:10.940 --> 32:13.260
We are the best gift
life has given each other.

32:14.660 --> 32:16.220
Even if life is a mess,

32:16.860 --> 32:17.980
having this gift

32:18.400 --> 32:19.890
is still something to be glad about.

32:19.890 --> 32:21.955
Then, don't let me
run into your wife again.

32:23.220 --> 32:24.420
I know you are married.

32:25.400 --> 32:27.288
I also know that it's your boundary.

32:28.060 --> 32:29.860
So you don't need to say it to my face.

32:30.940 --> 32:31.660
Doing that

32:32.580 --> 32:34.260
only makes me feel you look down on me

32:34.820 --> 32:36.220
or on what we have.

32:43.020 --> 32:44.900
When I have gatherings with friends,

32:45.020 --> 32:45.980
if my wife is free,

32:45.980 --> 32:47.220
I bring her along.

32:48.500 --> 32:49.330
Usually,

32:49.330 --> 32:51.380
I don't get many chances
to have meals with her.

32:52.700 --> 32:54.780
I am not always willing,

32:55.460 --> 32:56.140
but...

32:58.140 --> 32:59.460
sometimes, I feel

33:00.660 --> 33:01.940
I should.

33:05.540 --> 33:06.780
Let me tell you one more thing.

33:09.260 --> 33:10.860
Your wife has probably noticed us.

33:13.688 --> 33:15.500
Do not underestimate
a woman's intuition.

33:16.900 --> 33:17.540
This time,

33:18.660 --> 33:19.820
you made it worse.

33:21.860 --> 33:22.700
So, I suggest

33:23.300 --> 33:24.660
you don't send Zhang Yousen away.

33:25.700 --> 33:26.940
Otherwise, your wife will think

33:27.333 --> 33:28.933
it's because you are jealous.

33:32.220 --> 33:33.900
I'll handle things with Zhang Yousen.

33:34.400 --> 33:35.977
He shouldn't be dragged into this.

33:36.511 --> 33:38.420
Since we both think he
is a good young man,

33:39.140 --> 33:39.900
let's

33:40.460 --> 33:41.100
protect him.

33:51.620 --> 33:52.300
Mrs. Bei,

33:53.133 --> 33:54.444
what a coincidence.

33:58.200 --> 33:59.622
I came to see him about something.

33:59.630 --> 34:01.866
The secretary said
he was dining here, so I came over.

34:02.580 --> 34:04.860
I am here to speak to Lawyer Bei
on Zhang Yousen's behalf.

34:05.220 --> 34:06.180
He made a small mistake.

34:06.266 --> 34:07.460
Please give him another chance.

34:07.577 --> 34:08.488
It won't happen again.

34:11.044 --> 34:12.160
Another place setting, please.

34:12.177 --> 34:13.488
Ma'am, your utensils.

34:22.733 --> 34:23.420
Please enjoy.

34:23.555 --> 34:23.940
Thank you.

34:24.020 --> 34:24.666
Thank you.

34:25.620 --> 34:26.500
I didn't expect

34:27.060 --> 34:28.660
you to care so much

34:28.733 --> 34:30.200
about your boyfriend, Miss Zhou.

34:30.380 --> 34:31.980
I thought someone like you

34:32.260 --> 34:32.940
would have men

34:33.060 --> 34:34.940
caring about you instead.

34:37.300 --> 34:39.060
Whether someone cares is fate.

34:39.260 --> 34:40.780
It has nothing to do with looks.

34:42.100 --> 34:43.140
I have never had

34:43.780 --> 34:45.140
an easy life.

34:46.780 --> 34:48.420
Zhang Yousen is a good young man.

34:49.140 --> 34:51.820
But forgive me for saying this,

34:52.540 --> 34:53.100
Miss Zhou,

34:53.222 --> 34:54.266
with your conditions,

34:54.500 --> 34:55.540
you should find someone

34:56.380 --> 34:58.340
better, someone who can take care of you

34:58.500 --> 34:59.060
and let you

34:59.340 --> 35:00.460
live without worry.

35:00.540 --> 35:00.940
Right?

35:04.300 --> 35:05.111
Alright then.

35:05.580 --> 35:06.860
If there is a chance,

35:07.133 --> 35:08.777
Mrs. Bei, please
introduce someone to me.

35:12.180 --> 35:13.380
I'll find time

35:13.620 --> 35:15.220
to speak to Zhang Yousen.

35:16.260 --> 35:17.180
I hope you

35:17.260 --> 35:19.200
will also remind him
to focus on his work

35:19.540 --> 35:20.620
and not let play

35:20.980 --> 35:22.300
delay what matters.

35:22.660 --> 35:23.060
Alright.

35:23.540 --> 35:24.644
Thank you, Lawyer Bei.

35:25.900 --> 35:27.370
Please enjoy your meal.

35:27.370 --> 35:28.377
I'll take my leave.

35:28.780 --> 35:29.688
Excuse me, the bill.

35:30.140 --> 35:31.300
No need. I'll pay.

35:31.580 --> 35:32.100
You go ahead.

35:32.620 --> 35:34.500
I asked for your help,
so I cannot let you pay.

35:35.180 --> 35:35.700
It's fine.

36:13.420 --> 36:15.340
At last night's Author Night,

36:15.660 --> 36:16.580
the spotlight

36:17.100 --> 36:17.860
belonged to Gu Yan.

36:19.260 --> 36:20.220
But Lin Zhanqiao

36:21.060 --> 36:21.820
belonged to He Han.

36:23.980 --> 36:25.540
At a time like this, we,

36:25.740 --> 36:27.540
especially you, should give it a push.

36:27.688 --> 36:29.177
What is broken can come back together.

36:31.060 --> 36:32.580
May I ask you something?

36:32.740 --> 36:34.155
Ask as many as you like.

36:35.700 --> 36:39.260
Earlier, when Zhiyuan withdrew
their investment from Lin Zhanqiao,

36:40.140 --> 36:42.340
was it you or Zhao Lanxin

36:42.340 --> 36:43.460
who tipped them off?

36:44.860 --> 36:45.580
Look,

36:46.660 --> 36:48.180
Zhiyuan already

36:48.260 --> 36:49.500
made it clear.

36:49.860 --> 36:50.180
Right?

36:50.580 --> 36:52.220
It was just a coincidence.

36:54.180 --> 36:57.420
They were eating there,
and someone at the next table

36:57.420 --> 36:59.000
was talking about Lin Zhanqiao's

36:59.088 --> 37:01.540
newly signed authors,
saying she could not pay them.

37:01.620 --> 37:03.540
And it just so happened
you were at that table.

37:05.140 --> 37:05.740
Well...

37:06.580 --> 37:08.380
How would I know someone was listening?

37:08.380 --> 37:11.260
So, all of this was your doing.

37:11.700 --> 37:14.130
On one hand,

37:14.130 --> 37:16.288
you shook the investor's
confidence in Lin Zhanqiao,

37:16.540 --> 37:18.820
and on the other,
you had Zhao Lanxin intercept

37:18.820 --> 37:20.820
new authors
Lin Zhanqiao hadn't paid yet.

37:21.820 --> 37:22.780
And on your side,

37:23.260 --> 37:25.540
you pretend to be so loyal

37:26.180 --> 37:27.420
and ready to take over anytime.

37:28.600 --> 37:30.044
I did all this because of you.

37:33.660 --> 37:34.300
Because I know

37:35.580 --> 37:37.940
you are worried
they might get back together,

37:38.620 --> 37:39.020
right?

37:44.380 --> 37:47.100
After all, you are new here.

37:49.177 --> 37:50.533
If you don't want to eat, get out.

37:50.940 --> 37:51.580
I eat.

37:53.780 --> 37:54.100
I eat.

37:56.180 --> 37:58.288
(Dingqi Author Night ends,
lighting up Shanghai.)

38:03.540 --> 38:04.180
Mantou,

38:04.740 --> 38:05.580
is this true?

38:06.180 --> 38:07.700
So, Mr. He Han is coming back?

38:08.260 --> 38:09.500
Most likely.

38:09.977 --> 38:10.940
When Ms. Lin comes later,

38:10.940 --> 38:12.420
don't start gossiping.

38:12.500 --> 38:13.700
Let her announce it herself.

38:13.940 --> 38:15.580
After all that, they are back together.

38:15.580 --> 38:17.422
Looks like wedding candy
is coming this time.

38:17.430 --> 38:18.330
They should have
gotten married long ago.

38:18.340 --> 38:19.170
It's not too late.

38:19.170 --> 38:21.177
Had they married early,
they might have divorced early too.

38:21.180 --> 38:22.340
But recently, I thought

38:22.340 --> 38:23.780
our boss and Gu Yan were together.

38:23.780 --> 38:26.130
Once you have seen the ocean,
no other water compares, you know?

38:26.140 --> 38:27.860
Gu Yan left with our boss yesterday.

38:27.911 --> 38:29.155
Why are there no photos of them?

38:29.340 --> 38:29.980
Who knows?

38:30.300 --> 38:31.020
Zhangzhu,

38:31.380 --> 38:32.900
you are with our boss every day.

38:32.900 --> 38:34.180
Any inside news?

38:34.700 --> 38:35.700
I didn't notice anything.

38:35.980 --> 38:36.420
Ms. Lin.

38:37.900 --> 38:38.300
Ms. Lin.

38:38.500 --> 38:39.980
These are the updated drafts.

38:44.466 --> 38:45.660
Has Gu Yan submitted his draft?

38:46.060 --> 38:47.420
Not yet. I'll remind him now.

38:47.866 --> 38:48.900
I'll go to him myself.

38:49.780 --> 38:50.260
Okay.

39:08.420 --> 39:09.500
The update is not ready yet?

39:10.300 --> 39:11.133
I am writing it.

39:11.660 --> 39:12.800
I'll send it to you later.

39:13.300 --> 39:14.666
You don't need to come here.

39:15.700 --> 39:16.740
Then, we will talk later.

39:16.955 --> 39:18.460
I have a project meeting this afternoon.

39:18.460 --> 39:19.820
After it ends, I'll come to you.

39:23.220 --> 39:26.180
Lin Zhanqiao, He Han,
and I used to be colleagues.

39:27.020 --> 39:28.460
So I saw their relationship

39:28.460 --> 39:29.620
with my own eyes.

39:30.820 --> 39:32.650
You wouldn't want He Han to come back

39:32.650 --> 39:34.020
and work with Lin Zhanqiao again.

39:34.980 --> 39:36.260
Emotionally,

39:36.355 --> 39:38.660
they are old lovers,
reuniting after a long separation.

39:39.066 --> 39:41.622
Their closeness will
definitely be stronger than before.

39:42.140 --> 39:42.860
And accordingly,

39:42.860 --> 39:44.060
the time she spends on you

39:44.300 --> 39:45.340
will decrease.

39:46.540 --> 39:46.900
Second,

39:47.340 --> 39:48.500
for Dingqi,

39:48.900 --> 39:49.940
publicity aside,

39:50.100 --> 39:51.660
He Han is still more valuable than you.

39:52.377 --> 39:54.755
Once you start competing
under the same company,

39:55.060 --> 39:56.180
wherever you go,

39:56.580 --> 39:58.220
you will still be
overshadowed by He Han.

39:58.644 --> 39:59.822
You want to poach me?

40:00.100 --> 40:01.300
Of course, you would say that.

40:01.380 --> 40:03.200
I don't deny that I want to poach you.

40:03.500 --> 40:04.860
Otherwise, why would I come to you?

40:06.860 --> 40:08.420
But I am not trying to force you.

40:09.100 --> 40:10.930
Nor do I expect that after hearing this,

40:10.930 --> 40:12.180
you will lean toward me.

40:13.300 --> 40:14.020
I have always

40:14.260 --> 40:15.820
done better than I speak.

40:17.460 --> 40:18.780
As long as you give me a chance,

40:19.100 --> 40:20.020
I'll show you

40:20.420 --> 40:22.180
what it means to value you

40:22.288 --> 40:25.155
and what it means to see you as the
most important person in the company.

40:25.180 --> 40:26.311
From nothing to something,

40:26.511 --> 40:28.888
it was Lin Zhanqiao who
helped me find my worth.

40:29.460 --> 40:30.340
At least for now,

40:30.340 --> 40:32.133
I am still her most important author.

40:36.060 --> 40:36.980
To be fair,

40:37.460 --> 40:39.420
Lin Zhanqiao never really spent

40:39.420 --> 40:40.577
that much time on you.

40:41.540 --> 40:42.660
You have had it hard.

40:42.900 --> 40:45.333
You are used to no one
managing you or caring about you.

40:45.511 --> 40:47.660
So, when Lin Zhanqiao
gives you a little sweetness,

40:47.688 --> 40:49.488
you think you have
gained the whole world.

40:50.460 --> 40:51.380
Without comparison,

40:51.740 --> 40:52.820
don't rush to conclusions.

40:52.820 --> 40:54.600
I think things are already good now.

40:54.780 --> 40:56.780
I trust Lin Zhanqiao.
I don't need comparisons.

40:59.780 --> 41:01.460
I just don't want He Han's arrival

41:02.140 --> 41:03.620
to change how things are now.

41:06.540 --> 41:07.700
I am only telling you

41:08.100 --> 41:09.180
that you deserve better.

41:11.860 --> 41:12.540
I'll go now.

41:12.955 --> 41:14.460
Otherwise, if Lin Zhanqiao comes

41:14.460 --> 41:15.540
and sees me here with you,

41:15.580 --> 41:17.350
you'll have an even
harder time explaining it.

41:21.860 --> 41:22.820
Call me anytime.

41:23.100 --> 41:24.100
Twenty-four hours a day.

41:24.340 --> 41:25.980
Call me when you have no one to talk to.

41:36.460 --> 41:37.740
Xiaolongbao. Enjoy.

41:37.980 --> 41:38.540
Thank you.

41:59.900 --> 42:00.300
Hello?

42:00.688 --> 42:01.822
What are you doing?

42:01.933 --> 42:03.777
Has Mr. Fan's contract been signed?

42:03.780 --> 42:05.466
I have already
revised it and sent it over,

42:05.470 --> 42:06.844
but he hasn't replied yet.

42:06.940 --> 42:07.822
Did you chase him?

42:08.020 --> 42:08.420
No.

42:09.500 --> 42:10.260
That is right.

42:10.540 --> 42:12.780
The more casual you seem now,
the better. Understand?

42:13.500 --> 42:15.300
And you can even make the contract terms

42:15.300 --> 42:16.500
a little tougher.

42:16.500 --> 42:17.740
The harder you are to deal with,

42:17.740 --> 42:19.977
the more determined
he will be to get it. Understand?

42:20.700 --> 42:21.777
What are you doing tonight?

42:21.980 --> 42:23.100
How about we go watch a movie

42:23.300 --> 42:24.466
and give it a push?

42:27.700 --> 42:28.940
Or we can just have dinner.

42:29.220 --> 42:30.444
I happen to discuss with you.

42:31.155 --> 42:33.088
Tonight, at the French restaurant
near Chenxing.

42:33.100 --> 42:34.177
I'll book the table.

42:34.644 --> 42:36.600
When the time comes, we split the bill.

42:38.266 --> 42:40.180
Dinner is fine,
but no splitting the bill.

42:40.300 --> 42:41.650
I am here to help you.

42:41.650 --> 42:43.380
You should pay for the meal, right?

42:46.700 --> 42:47.140
Fine.

42:48.044 --> 42:49.000
See you tonight.

43:05.921 --> 43:07.041
(I've been thinking.)

43:08.321 --> 43:11.601
(Everyone's most comfortable level of intimacy)

43:12.361 --> 43:19.691
(is probably different.)

43:20.691 --> 43:22.441
♪If the sky♪

43:22.951 --> 43:24.351
♪And the sea♪

43:24.891 --> 43:26.601
♪Turned upside down♪

43:28.161 --> 43:30.091
♪If a swimming fish♪

43:30.491 --> 43:33.881
♪Fell in love with a flying bird♪

43:35.651 --> 43:37.621
♪If back then♪

43:37.981 --> 43:42.391
♪We had never let go♪

43:42.991 --> 43:49.271
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

43:50.391 --> 43:52.541
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

43:52.541 --> 43:54.411
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

43:54.591 --> 43:57.031
♪And found our way back whole♪

43:57.871 --> 44:00.041
♪So let this surging love♪

44:00.041 --> 44:04.471
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

44:05.371 --> 44:07.551
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

44:07.551 --> 44:08.641
♪That's alright♪

44:09.181 --> 44:09.931
♪If we're buried♪

44:09.931 --> 44:12.631
♪By passing years all the better♪

44:12.891 --> 44:15.071
♪At least we still can keep♪

44:15.251 --> 44:19.671
♪This one eternal photograph♪

44:35.431 --> 44:37.721
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

44:37.721 --> 44:39.481
♪Running in opposite ways♪

44:39.601 --> 44:42.071
♪Searching all along the way♪

44:42.871 --> 44:45.031
♪For the fire of our younger hearts♪

44:45.221 --> 44:50.131
♪And the beauty lost in time♪

44:50.131 --> 44:53.651
♪This time don't lose each other again♪

44:53.891 --> 44:54.861
♪Only after loss♪

44:54.861 --> 44:57.491
♪Do we learn what truly matters most♪

44:57.901 --> 45:00.261
♪In another time and space♪

45:00.261 --> 45:01.821
♪We'll stay and walk together♪

45:01.821 --> 45:04.651
♪Till we grow old♪

45:05.611 --> 45:07.901
♪But still the sky will never♪

45:07.901 --> 45:10.571
♪Turn with the sea♪

45:13.091 --> 45:15.501
♪But still a swimming fish won't♪

45:15.501 --> 45:20.711
♪Fall in love with a flying bird♪
